{"slug":"Your-Bizarre-Adventure-Yba-Script-Azure-Hub-73563","_id":"69375d50d77d82777ca810e2","title":"Yba Script Methion Hub","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e40","gameId":2809202155,"name":"[CDR & DD] Your Bizarre Adventure","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":2809202155},"features":"YBA Azure Hub | Azure Edition v1.0\nA feature-rich, optimized script for Your Bizarre Adventure\n\nGame: Your Bizarre Adventure (YBA)\nUI Library: WindUI (Custom Fork)\nExecutor Compatibility: Script-Ware, Delta, Velocity(Instant TP warning for unsupported executors)\n\n---\n\n> Core Features\n\n> Automated Farming:\n- Dual Farming Modes: Normal & AFK with intelligent pathfinding\n- Multi-Method Travel: Stud-step, Tween, and Instant teleportation\n- Smart Targeting: Lucky Arrow priority, selective item farming, max stack detection\n- Dynamic Selling: Auto-sell on max stacks, worthless item clearing, inventory management\n\n> Stand & Rib Farming:\n- Automated Stand Rolling: Complete Arrow/Rokakaka automation\n- Pity System: Target pity amount with auto-kick when reached\n- 28 Stand Selection: Toggle which stands to keep/sell\n- Shiny Detection: Auto-preserve any shiny stands\n- Rib Cage Farming: Full Saint's Corpse part automation\n\n> Real-Time Stats:\n- Live pity counter with percentage calculation\n- Current stand & shiny display\n- Stand wishlist tracking\n\n> Visual Enhancements:\n- Item ESP: Green/red highlight with item name labels\n- Player ESP: Red fill/white outline with name tags\n- Spawn Notifiers: Sound & popup alerts for specific items\n- AFK Camera: Rotating cinematic camera during farming\n\n> Performance & Utility:\n- FPS Booster: Optimized lighting and shadow settings\n- Anti-AFK: Built-in idle prevention\n- Auto-Rejoin: Detects kicks and automatically rejoins server\n- Config System: Save/load all settings with multiple profiles\n- Theme Selector: 15+ UI themes included\n\n> Trolling & Fun:\n- Stand Pilot: Full stand control with adjustable speed\n- Fly Hack: 3D movement with WASD controls\n- Sticker: Attach player/stand to targets with multiple modes\n- View Stand: Orbit camera for spectating your stand\n\n> Level Farming:\n- Automated quest completion based on player level\n- Enemy targeting & killing\n- Item collection for quests\n- Stand utilization for combat\n\n> SBR Optimized:\n- Steel Ball Run Mode: Automatic detection with teleport presets\n- Horse Controls: Speed/jump adjustments\n- Barrier Teleports: Instant stage progression\n- Player ESP: Red barrier no-clip options\n\n> Integrated Shop:\n- One-click purchase all items & specs\n- Price display and confirmation\n- Special dialogue triggers (Jesus, Halloween, etc.)\n\n---\n\n> Usage\n1. Inject with a supported executor\n2. Execute script (keybind: K to toggle UI)\n3. Configure your preferences in the Settings tab\n4. Enable desired features - the script handles the rest!\n\n---\n\n> Important Notes\n- Instant Travel: May kick on unsupported executors (use Stud/Tween for safety)\n- AFK Mode: Requires \"Enable Farming\" to be active\n- Pity Farming: Will kick you when target pity is reached\n- SBR Features: Only load when in Steel Ball Run\n\n---\n\nCredits: Zakori, Hori, Coowner-Diablo, Owner-Azurey\nDiscord: Copy link in About tab\nVersion: WindUI v1.0+","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Methions/External/refs/heads/main/Methion\"))()\n","owner":{"_id":"68f028796ca1c83b870c8dad","username":"4zury","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c1579cfaa055b2b599dc79eedf89adc71809b22fd3e7b15b8e1bfb6cc48b05cd.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68f028796ca1c83b870c8dad-1765236072823.png"},"status":"offline","id":"68f028796ca1c83b870c8dad","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c1579cfaa055b2b599dc79eedf89